4. Ideas and integration approaches  -- no code copied
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Several techniques were learned from GGZ14/vllm-mxfp4 (NVFP4 -> MXFP4
    requantisation at load, merging the GDN in_proj pair, converting fp8 dense
    layers to MXFP4) and implemented independently here. Ideas are not
    copyrightable and nothing is carved out on their account; the credit in
    CREDITS.md is given because it is deserved, not because it is required.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Runtime dependencies  -- not redistributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    vLLM, ROCm, PyTorch and Triton are used unmodified at runtime and are not
    included here. libr4d's binary (r4d.so) is loaded at runtime when present
    and is NOT redistributed by this repository (.gitignore excludes *.so); the
    stack runs without it, using our own kernels.

See CREDITS.md for the full attribution table and notes/independence.md for what
was replaced with original work and what each piece is measurably worth.
